1. Attribution Requirement (Mandatory)

All use of the Software, whether in original or modified form, must include
clear and visible attribution to organization DARJYO and author/developer Darshani Persadh(~persadian).

Attribution must be included in at least one of the following:

* Documentation or README files
* Academic papers or technical publications
* Model cards, dataset cards, or system descriptions
* Product or service acknowledgements (where applicable)

Required attribution text:

- “Built by Darshani Persadh(~persadian) with DARJYO Technology”
- “Powered by DARJYO Technology”

Where technically possible, a reference link to the original repository or
official model page must be included.

