2. Citation Requirement (Research and Benchmark Use)

Any academic, research, benchmarking, evaluation, or publication that uses,
evaluates, fine-tunes, or references the Software must formally cite DARJYO.

Suggested example citation format:

DARSHANI PERSADH~persadian (2025)
CropSeek-LLM: Agricultural Domain Language Model
DARJYO Research Engineering
Available at: https://huggingface.co/persadian/CropSeek-LLM

Citation is considered a required condition for academic integrity and research use.

